  "Movies_and_TV:pairwise_accuracy": "P(positive score > negative score) + 0.5 P(tie), conditional on sampled negative difficulty; invariant to strictly increasing score transformations.",
  "Movies_and_TV:embedding_angular_alignment": "(Mean off-diagonal cosine + 1)/2; approximately 0.5 means zero mean cosine. Not a ranking-quality or semantic-diversity metric.",
  "Movies_and_TV:representations": "Centered covariance eigenvalues for raw and unit-normalized vectors; total variance, largest eigenvalue share and exp(-sum(p log p)), where p is covariance eigenvalue mass. This is not RankMe. Zero variance has null effective rank.",
  "Movies_and_TV:structure": "Inspection of actual NextItNet residual blocks, temporal convolutions, positionwise norms, biases, explicit causal padding and masks. Reachability is conditional on this recognized graph and absence of unrecognized operations.",
